#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:5 5f9c009282c24bd0a6a1b1bdb20e5653
msgid "Choosing Servo Functions"
msgstr "选择舵机功能"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:7 062c7fb9681649a2931d78380b638600
msgid ""
"The most fundamental setup for any plane is the servo output functions. "
"Each type of plane frame type will require different servo output "
"functions to controls its motor(s) and control surfaces. Flight boards "
"vary in the number of outputs they support,some with as few as 6 outputs "
"and others with up to 16. Each of these outputs can be configured as "
"needed for your airframe."
msgstr ""
"任何飞机最基本的设置是舵机输出功能。每种飞机机架类型都需要不同的舵机输出功能来控制其电机和控制面。飞控板输出数量各异，有的只有 6 "
"个输出，有的多达 16 个。每个输出均可根据机架需要配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:13 da4bc72f47274e829ff80b23ef1561a4
msgid "The default outputs for a standard plane frame are very simple:"
msgstr "标准飞机机架的默认输出非常简单："

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:15 a475fd97a46447df990a7baa03fd197f
msgid "servo output 1 is aileron"
msgstr "舵机输出 1 为副翼"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:16 cfa9b58a63bc4bc5a230961aa5af6168
msgid "servo output 2 is elevator"
msgstr "舵机输出 2 为升降舵"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:17 83c9524b4fcf43008b018bdf0cc31b33
msgid "servo output 3 is throttle"
msgstr "舵机输出 3 为油门"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:18 7abca2d0bd9549d3a6c3420783d17d73
msgid "servo output 4 is rudder"
msgstr "舵机输出 4 为方向舵"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:20 e4a27d2ef3a64aaabaf2c4ba1bff7894
msgid ""
"This is fine for many simple aircraft, but will need to be changed if you"
" have elevons, a vtail, flaps or any other more complex setup, such as "
"QuadPlane or Tail-sitter."
msgstr "这对许多简单飞机来说已足够，但若有升降副翼、V 尾、襟翼或其他更复杂的设置（如 QuadPlane 或尾坐机），则需要更改。"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:24 c2247bbf663e4e1aa877f10c03cd7bb7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:26 d96b391f212247ad848dcfc87508ffcf
msgid ""
"Each of the servo output functions is settable with the corresponding "
"SERVOn_FUNCTION parameter. The defaults are:"
msgstr "每个舵机输出功能可通过相应的 SERVOn_FUNCTION 参数设置。默认值为："

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:40 45c782a7dff04d7a811b9fa000977e78
msgid "Available Output Functions"
msgstr "可用输出功能"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:42 60129c1c28a24203a84e1011008c25d4
msgid ""
"Each of your servo outputs can be configured to a wide range of possible "
"functions. See the Plane Functions section of :ref:`common-rcoutput-"
"mapping` section."
msgstr "每个舵机输出可配置为多种可能的功能。请参阅 :ref:`common-rcoutput-mapping` 章节中的 Plane 功能部分。"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:45 070607aea21c404eb046abf20c61d570
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In addition, there are servo functions for control of internal combustion"
" engines, pass-through of controls from RC inputs, camera controls, "
"control of motor tilt functions for tilt-rotors and many others. Those "
"functions are also discussed in the :ref:`common-rcoutput-mapping` "
"section."
msgstr ""
"此外，还有用于内燃机控制、RC 输入直通、摄像机控制、倾转旋翼电机倾转功能控制等的舵机功能。这些功能也在 :ref:`common-"
"rcoutput-mapping` 章节中讨论。"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:52 4cd4ddaf19da454c9f3eca628e25b800
msgid "Controlling Servo Throw, Trim and Reversal"
msgstr "控制舵机行程、微调与反向"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:54 8b0c7fdda68640d98542cbb0cd0287f2
msgid ""
"In addition to the function, each servo output also has parameters to "
"control the servo throw, the trim and servo reversal. Normally, no "
"adjustment is needed, but can be modified to match your servo's "
"capabilities and range. While these values can be used to adjust throw "
"and trim center of a flying surface, it is best to do so mechanically. "
":ref:`SERVO_AUTO_TRIM<SERVO_AUTO_TRIM>` can be used to fine adjust the "
"TRIM value automatically in flight, instead of manually changing the "
"mechanical trim. NEVER try to trim a plane with the transmitter trims as "
"this will destroy the RC Calibration values (See :ref:`common-radio-"
"control-calibration`)."
msgstr ""
"除功能外，每个舵机输出还有参数用于控制舵机行程、微调和反向。通常不需要调整，但可以修改以匹配舵机的能力和范围。虽然这些值可用于调整飞行面的行程和微调中心，但最好通过机械方式调整。:ref:`SERVO_AUTO_TRIM<SERVO_AUTO_TRIM>`"
" 可用于在飞行中自动微调 TRIM 值，而非手动更改机械微调。切勿使用遥控器微调来调整飞机，这会破坏 RC 校准值（参见 :ref"
":`common-radio-control-calibration`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:60 67df142cb8f847aca0bd06877fa61688
msgid ""
"When using reversing ESCs, these values may be needed to be adjusted (See"
" :ref:`reverse-thrust-setup` )"
msgstr "使用可逆 ESC 时，可能需要调整这些值（参见 :ref:`reverse-thrust-setup`）"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:62 d643fddecd7748a1b9e776a164f97dba
msgid "The parameters are:"
msgstr "参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:64 ca3d6dc212d34e3e982ec526b4ee77ba
msgid "SERVOn_MIN is the minimum PWM output value"
msgstr "SERVOn_MIN 为最小 PWM 输出值"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:65 802f43f3a0114cc4bfb16485a15e6f15
msgid "SERVOn_MAX is the maximum PWM output value"
msgstr "SERVOn_MAX 为最大 PWM 输出值"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:66 9c5ccc06b6ed4b86b857535017f45c69
msgid "SERVOn_TRIM is the trim value for output types that have trim"
msgstr "SERVOn_TRIM 为有微调的输出类型的微调值"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:67 b21a73f88fdf44029262f0309bf55e8d
msgid "SERVOn_REVERSED controls servo reversal"
msgstr "SERVOn_REVERSED 控制舵机反向"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:69 d7a93b2180be4486a04d401794157080
msgid "For example, if you have:"
msgstr "例如，若您有："

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:82 c356f86804ef4e20bce443316f1f2695
msgid ""
"then that would setup servo output 5 as a reversed left elevon, with a "
"throw from 1000 to 2000, and a trim of 1504."
msgstr "则这将把舵机输出 5 设置为反向左升降副翼，行程从 1000 到 2000，微调为 1504。"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:86 e0c5ed330cdf48a295e16547f4c7bf46
msgid "Multiple Outputs for One Type"
msgstr "同一类型的多个输出"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:88 e2c27f7753074c609be4f5f1f8de380b
msgid ""
"The SERVOn_FUNCTION values can be assigned to any output, and you can "
"have multiple output channels with the same output function. For example,"
" you can have multiple output channels marked as aileron (function 4) and"
" set the throws and trim on each aileron separately. This allows you to "
"trim your left and right ailerons differently to account for differences "
"in servo trim."
msgstr ""
"SERVOn_FUNCTION 值可分配给任意输出，且可以有多个输出通道使用相同的输出功能。例如，可以将多个输出通道标记为副翼（功能 "
"4），并分别设置每个副翼的行程和微调。这允许您分别微调左右副翼以补偿舵机微调差异。"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:96 7dcbd42aef0747368115580b3369e7cf
msgid "Setup of Specific Aircraft Types"
msgstr "特定机架类型的设置"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:98 e68ac995fd9f402eb3dabf8c04a6df1b
msgid ""
"Now that you understand the basics of the servo output functions you "
"should read the guide for your particular type of aircraft."
msgstr "了解舵机输出功能的基础知识后，应阅读针对您特定机架类型的指南。"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:101 70837d5ade244e57ae732c7f6e5a84e9
msgid ""
"Before you do that, however, you should make sure you have correctly "
"setup your :ref:`RC inputs <rc-throw-trim>`."
msgstr "但在此之前，应确保已正确设置 :ref:`RC 输入 <rc-throw-trim>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:112 bf84ea4525744f0289de50d1bf0c8122
msgid ""
"For QuadPlanes, including Tailsitters and Tilt-Rotors, see these "
"sections: :ref:`quadplane-support`, :ref:`guide-tailsitter`, :ref:`guide-"
"tilt-rotor`"
msgstr ""
"对于 QuadPlane，包括尾坐机和倾转旋翼，请参阅以下章节：:ref:`quadplane-support`、:ref:`guide-"
"tailsitter`、:ref:`guide-tilt-rotor`"

#: ../../source/docs/servo-functions.rst:114 d8b5173be5b04a039468bf5a184fcb3e
msgid ""
"You can combine setups for more complex aircraft. So for example, you "
"could setup a vtail tiltrotor quadplane by combining functions from the "
"guides above."
msgstr "可以组合设置以适应更复杂的飞机。例如，可以通过组合上述指南中的功能来设置 V 尾倾转旋翼四旋翼飞机。"

